The text in this repository is the Constitution and statutes of the Commonwealth of Puerto Rico, taken from the Biblioteca Virtual of the
Oficina de Gerencia y Presupuesto del Gobierno de Puerto Rico (www.ogp.pr.gov), revision of 15 April 2024:
https://bvirtualogp.pr.gov/ogp/Bvirtual/leyesreferencia/PDF/Derechos%20Civiles/CONST/CONST.pdf
(the Constitution) and, for statutes, the OGP compilations under https://bvirtualogp.pr.gov/ogp/Bvirtual/leyesreferencia/PDF/ named in README.md.
The publisher states no licence. Attribution: "Source: Oficina de Gerencia y Presupuesto, Gobierno de Puerto Rico."
Lexifina's tooling and documentation in this repository are released under the MIT licence.
